            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Fukuyama, Julie, et al. (2017). \"Docker, Data and Rmd supplementary data and source code files for the study of Multidomain Analyses of a Longitudinal Human Microbiome Intestinal Cleanout Perturbation Experiment.\" Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/cf264md0197",
